# Format:
# Number|ScriptName|FileName

# Example:
# 0|Exit|Exit
# 1|Git-Aliases|Git-Aliases.sh

# Note:
# Files of the scripts included in "Git-Launcher_Info.conf" have to be in "Scripts" directory.
# Exit option name should be either "Exit" or "exit" to make it work without changing code.


# To make it work you need:
# 1. Create or rename this file with the name "Git-Launcher_Info.conf" in "Configs" directory.
# 2. Add there options following the format and example written up there.
# 3. Run "Git-Launcher.sh".
# Or download "Git-Launcher_Info.conf" from the GitHub repository "https://github.com/RuslOFFICIAL/Git-Scripts".
